#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:70
msgid ""
"An MCP server that lets an AI assistant manage Proxmox, SSH hosts and "
"Docker. I use it every day to run my homelab."
msgstr ""
"Un serveur MCP qui permet à un assistant IA de gérer Proxmox, des hôtes SSH "
"et Docker. Je m'en sers tous les jours pour gérer mon homelab."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:71
#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:82
msgid "View GitHub Project"
msgstr "Voir le projet sur GitHub"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:81
msgid ""
"A menu bar app that runs Apple's echo cancellation on the mic, so calls stay"
" clean with speakers on."
msgstr ""
"Une app de barre de menus qui applique l'annulation d'écho d'Apple au micro "
": les appels restent propres même avec les haut-parleurs allumés."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:91
#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:120
msgid "networking"
msgstr "réseau"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:94
msgid ""
"Two Proxmox nodes running game panels, bots, VPN routing and self-hosted "
"services, all behind tunnels."
msgstr ""
"Deux nœuds Proxmox qui font tourner des panels de jeux, des bots, du routage"
" VPN et des services auto-hébergés, le tout derrière des tunnels."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:95
msgid "This site runs on it"
msgstr "Ce site tourne dessus"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:102
msgid "What I work on"
msgstr "Ce que je fais"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:108
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sécurité"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:109
msgid ""
"CTF challenges and reverse engineering, from binaries to WebAssembly modules"
" hooked live in the browser."
msgstr ""
"Des CTF et de la rétro-ingénierie, des binaires aux modules WebAssembly "
"instrumentés en direct dans le navigateur."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:110
msgid "Reverse engineering, WebAssembly"
msgstr "Rétro-ingénierie, WebAssembly"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:113
msgid "AI tooling"
msgstr "Outils IA"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:114
msgid ""
"MCP servers that give language models safe access to real infrastructure, "
"and LLM-backed web apps."
msgstr ""
"Des serveurs MCP qui donnent aux modèles de langage un accès sûr à de la "
"vraie infrastructure, et des applis web basées sur des LLM."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:118
msgid "Infrastructure"
msgstr "Infrastructure"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:119
msgid ""
"A two-node Proxmox cluster at home: containers, VMs, GPU passthrough, "
"tunnels and the debugging that comes with them."
msgstr ""
"Un cluster Proxmox de deux nœuds chez moi : conteneurs, VM, passthrough GPU,"
" tunnels, et tout le débogage qui va avec."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:123
msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Au quotidien"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:124
msgid "French (native) and English (C1)."
msgstr "Français (langue maternelle) et anglais (C1)."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:133
msgid "Education and experience"
msgstr "Formation et expérience"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:139
msgid "2026 to 2031"
msgstr "2026 à 2031"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:145
msgid "Engineering degree in computer science"
msgstr "Diplôme d'ingénieur en informatique"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:146
msgid ""
"Five-year programme: two years of core engineering sciences, then the "
"computer science (INFO) specialty."
msgstr ""
"Cursus en cinq ans : deux années de sciences de l'ingénieur, puis la "
"spécialité informatique (INFO)."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:150
msgid "System and network administrator, InsaLan"
msgstr "Administrateur systèmes et réseaux, InsaLan"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:151
msgid "Since 2026"
msgstr "Depuis 2026"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:153
msgid ""
"Student association behind the INSA Rennes LAN party. I run the network "
"side: internet access for every player and a Lancache game cache."
msgstr ""
"L'association étudiante qui organise la LAN de l'INSA Rennes. Je m'occupe du"
" réseau : l'accès internet de chaque joueur et un cache de jeux Lancache."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:164
msgid "Baccalauréat général"
msgstr "Baccalauréat général"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:165
msgid "Specialties in computer science (NSI) and mathematics."
msgstr "Spécialités informatique (NSI) et mathématiques."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:172
msgid "Let's talk"
msgstr "Parlons-en"

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:173
msgid ""
"Internships, projects or a question about something on this page. I usually "
"reply within a day or two."
msgstr ""
"Un stage, un projet ou une question sur cette page. Je réponds en général "
"sous un ou deux jours."

